WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.480
To find the origin of Malthus, the malefic
demon from hell’s deepest crevices, we must

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.830
look back to the ancient texts that first
detailed the infernal entity’s name: The

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.830
Devil’s Welcome.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:14.010
One page, studied by Mia Form in Annabelle,
tells of the Rite of Evocation, or the ceremony

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.810
of calling upon an evil spirit, demon or deity.
It says there is a fragment of the Dead Sea

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.790
Scrolls entitled “Curses of Belial” which
tells of the existence of demons. The Dead

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:27.359
Sea Scrolls are ancient Jewish manuscripts
found in Qumran Caves on the Dead Sea’s

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:31.450
western bank, so this book is suggesting that
there is actually a long lost piece called

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:36.200
Curses of Belial, reflecting the sentiments
shared by demons to prey on weak souls.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:40.330
Belial is a real term referenced in several
religious texts, which some religions have

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.580
personified as The Devil. So when Mia reads
about how Belial was thought to have influenced

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.650
sin through the way people addressed him and
all his guilty lot, she’s essentially learning

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:53.550
that the other demons mentioned in this fragment,
including Valak, Malthus and others all answer

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.550
to Belial.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.800
The Dead Sea Scrolls were discovered in 1947
and thought to be 1800 to 2000 years old,

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.850
making them the oldest copies of biblical
text ever discovered. If we take those dates

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:07.400
and apply them to the Conjuring universe,
we can estimate that the earliest recorded

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.220
text about Malthus was written around 20 BCE.
We’ll probably never know the actual creation

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.960
date of the demon, because this is as far
as it’s lore goes back. But that’s good

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.930
enough for me to put a date in the thumbnail.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:23.210
To learn about the ENTIRE history of the presence
that made this creepy children’s toy famous,

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:27.420
including how it may become the most powerful
being in the Conjuring universe, stick around

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.871
to the end of this video.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:38.610
Welcome to Horror History. My name is Professor
CZsWorld. What do they call me? A YouTuber,

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.060
an influencer, a creator.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.140
“Something inhuman.”

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:45.200
Something like that. Today’s lesson is Malthus,
who is most notably the antagonist of the

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:50.050
Annabelle spin-offs. Like many Conjuring villains,
Malthus is based on mythological folklore.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:54.590
The Lesser Key of Solomon is a 17th century
spellbook on demonology that contains details

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.860
about many of the demons found in popular
fiction, including Paimon from Hereditary

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:03.890
and Valak from The Conjuring 2. It’s divided
up into five titles. Ars Goetia focuses on

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.360
the practice of conjuring demons, so naturally,
it serves as a major source of lore for The

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.360
Conjuring franchise.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.490
It contains 72 demons, each one serving some
kind of role in the hierarchy of Hell. There

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:19.360
are Kings, Dukes, Princes, Marquises, Knights,
Presidents, and Earls. Malthus is considered

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.640
an Earl of Hell.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.700
Also sometimes known as Halphas, this demon
is not associated with the ram form as portrayed

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:30.230
in the movies, but rather as a wicked storc
with a hoarse voice. I just Malthus having the voice of Jeff Garlin.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.390
*Jeff Garlin laughter*

00:02:31.765 --> 00:02:36.500
Halphas is known for building up towns to
house weapons and ammunition for his 26 legions

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.830
of warrior demons, which he can send to attack
wherever he pleases.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.860
We see this concept realized in a different
way in Annabelle, where Malthus is the subject

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:48.170
of evocation for, not an army, but a cult
known as The Disciples of Ram. Let’s get

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:51.135
into the demon’s early interactions with
mankind.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:01.240
For as long as there have been religious entities,
those entities have had followers. Malthus’s

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.930
followers are a cult known as Disciples of
the Ram, a reference to the rarely seen true

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:09.910
form of the creature, a humanoid figure with
a ram-like horns. It also possesses long claw-like

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.930
fingers and charcoal-black features, which
are explained by Annabelle director John Leonetti:

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:19.660
“I wanted it to be like this thing had been
in Hell and it was jet-black, charred like

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:23.360
he’s really been in Hell and that was the
visual inspiration for it.”

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:27.570
He’s also got a beautiful goatee. That one
gets the CZ stamp of approval. Malthus is

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:31.370
your traditional gargoyle looking demon, which
works to thematically tie the character into

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:35.120
this idea of a religious clash. Which takes
me back to his milieu.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.650
The evocation page, (the page that explains
the summoning of the demon) mentions that

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.770
an incantation is to be performed with spilled
blood. We can’t see the entire text, but

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:46.569
it looks like the summoner should be both
impious and uncleanly. Looking at the two

00:03:46.569 --> 00:03:49.879
Disciples of Ram who perform the ritual in
Annabelle, I’d say they check those boxes

00:03:49.879 --> 00:03:52.690
pretty neatly. Especially the uncleanly part.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:56.811
Let’s move ahead to the chapter specifically
about Malthus and his Disciples of the Ram.

00:03:56.811 --> 00:04:00.349
This passage lays out the rules. In Layman’s
terms, in order for Malthus to take a soul

00:04:00.349 --> 00:04:04.790
and possess a body, the victim must agree
to give it up. Once the deal is made, it’s

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.319
everlasting, and the church fears this, because
if the demon tricks someone into doing this,

00:04:08.319 --> 00:04:10.239
there’s not really much they can do to fix
it.

00:04:10.239 --> 00:04:14.879
“Which brings us to the three stages of
demonic activity: Infestation, oppression

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:15.879
and possession.”

00:04:17.359 --> 00:04:21.659
Why don’t I have a projector screen like
that? Ed explains the first stage, infestation...

00:04:21.659 --> 00:04:26.600
“That's the whispering, the footsteps, the
feeling of another presence...which ultimately

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.916
grows into oppression, the second stage.

00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:32.719
This is definitely the case for Malthus, whose
targets include an orphan who is treated differently

00:04:32.719 --> 00:04:36.430
by the other girls for her disability, a new
mother who spends her days alone due to her

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:40.069
husband’s busy work schedule, a nurse who
can't say no to helping people, and a student

00:04:40.069 --> 00:04:42.530
who is desperate to make contact with her
deceased father.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:47.820
“Breaks the victim down. Crushes their will.
And, once in a weakened state, leads them

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.639
to the third and final stage: possession.”

00:04:50.639 --> 00:04:54.689
The Devil’s Welcome also explains a couple
more rules. As I mentioned, blood must be

00:04:54.689 --> 00:04:58.879
shed to summon him, but this is only to be
done as a sacrifice to Malthus. Whatever creature

00:04:58.879 --> 00:05:02.940
is sacrificed is not to be used for food,
unless it’s meat given to them by the demon

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.449
specifically for food.

00:05:04.449 --> 00:05:08.129
The last paragraph on the page says ”And
the bow shall be in the Earth, and I will

00:05:08.129 --> 00:05:12.229
establish my covenant unto thee, which I have
made between me and thee, for every living

00:05:12.229 --> 00:05:16.249
creature of all flesh that shall be upon this
Earth.” So he’s saying that he wants to

00:05:16.249 --> 00:05:20.089
take all the souls and possess every living
creature on the planet. So basically the same

00:05:20.089 --> 00:05:21.839
thing that the music industry is trying to
do.

00:05:21.839 --> 00:05:25.949
There’s a graphic on the right labeled Malthus,
Earl of Hell, the only time the antagonist

00:05:25.949 --> 00:05:30.050
is ever mentioned by name in the series, and
the picture shows the ram demon grabbing this

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:34.300
baby, which represents a common tactic he’s
known to use. By putting a baby in danger,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:38.529
he can sometimes pressure a naive mother into
offering her soul in exchange for the child’s

00:05:38.529 --> 00:05:39.529
safety.

00:05:40.685 --> 00:05:44.870
JOHN: “But you said that it can’t take Lia’s,
you said that it has to be offered.”

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:51.889
FATHER PEREZ: “Yes, and a baby can not offer it’s soul.”
JOHN: “Oh my God. Mia.”

00:05:51.889 --> 00:05:55.800
This wouldn’t be the only clever tactic
of deception used by the demon.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:06:02.119
FATHER PEREZ: “The devil is the father of lies. Demons
are his manipulators. No one ever plans to

00:06:02.119 --> 00:06:03.300
offer their soul.”

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:06.839
This presence would infest many homes over
the years, and each of them taught the fiend

00:06:06.839 --> 00:06:10.509
some new tricks, that it would carry on to
it’s next target, meaning if it isn’t

00:06:10.509 --> 00:06:14.539
contained, it could become more and more deceptive,
making it more and more powerful. We will

00:06:14.539 --> 00:06:18.306
pick up on some of these tricks as we follow
Malthus’s journey through history.

00:06:26.773 --> 00:06:31.289
Malthus’s earliest known targets were The
Mullins Family, Samuel and Esther. They lost

00:06:31.289 --> 00:06:35.809
their 7 year old daughter Annabelle “Bee”
Mullins to a car accident in 1943, so Malthus

00:06:35.809 --> 00:06:37.999
tried to manipulate them as they were mourning.

00:06:37.999 --> 00:06:42.119
The young girl’s diary was abruptly cut
short, but after many nights, a new message

00:06:42.119 --> 00:06:44.559
appeared: “Dear Diary. Today I came home.”

00:06:44.559 --> 00:06:47.169
“Annabelle Comes Home. Rated R.”

00:06:47.169 --> 00:06:49.599
Not yet, Annabelle Comes Home. We’re still
on Annabelle: Creation.

00:06:49.599 --> 00:06:53.559
It all started one night during dinner when
they heard Bee’s favorite record start playing

00:06:53.559 --> 00:06:55.610
randomly, and assumed it was her spirit.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:59.319
They noticed more and more activity that mimicked
the things that their daughter used to do,

00:06:59.319 --> 00:07:03.080
and eventually they found a note, asking for
their permission to move into this doll so

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.930
that she could be with them forever, and they
happily agreed.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:09.370
This was not the spirit of their deceased
daughter, however, and by falling for this

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:13.490
trick and having faith that they could speak
to Bee again, the evil entity got stronger.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:17.139
Soon, it could use the form of the Mullins
girl. They were able to see what they thought

00:07:17.139 --> 00:07:22.319
was her ghost in fleeting glimpses. This was
stage 1: infestation.

00:07:22.897 --> 00:07:26.699
“But we soon realized it wasn’t our Annabelle
at all.” 

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:37.630
“Demons. What do they want?”
“A soul. And they won’t stop until they

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:38.630
get one.”

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.839
Mrs. Mullins decided to approach one of the
apparitions with a cross, but what appeared

00:07:41.839 --> 00:07:46.309
to be her daughter convulsed and twisted itself
into a demonic form. She dropped the cross

00:07:46.309 --> 00:07:50.599
in shock and Malthus attacked her, scarring
her face and taking out her left eye.

00:07:50.599 --> 00:07:54.349
As the girl’s mother, Mrs. Mullins was the
most psychologically vulnerable. This was

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:58.330
stage 2: oppression. It had used her hope
of speaking to her daughter again to make

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:02.080
an attempt at her soul. Samuel reached out
to the church, and they saved Mrs. Mullins

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.861
from potentially being possessed, but the
evil was still attached to the doll, so it

00:08:05.861 --> 00:08:10.189
was locked away in Bee’s closet and surrounded
by Bible pages, a cross and doused with holy

00:08:10.189 --> 00:08:11.189
water.

00:08:11.189 --> 00:08:14.459
The demonic activity would cease, but the
Mullins’ did not realize the room would

00:08:14.459 --> 00:08:18.099
have to continuously be blessed in order for
the seal to remain strong.

00:08:18.099 --> 00:08:22.759
Four years later, in 1947, The Dead Sea Scroll
is discovered, and the word of Disciples of

00:08:22.759 --> 00:08:26.439
Ram would soon spread to the troubled group
of people that would start the cult.

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:30.389
Another 8 years go by, and Mr. Mullins and
his wife decide to take in a group of girls

00:08:30.389 --> 00:08:33.840
from St. Eustace Orphanage. They believed
that sheltering these girls would be their

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:38.300
penance, but they unknowingly gave Malthus
exactly what it wanted: a new, weaker target

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.432
whose soul was ripe for possession.

00:08:40.432 --> 00:08:42.868
“It’s been quiet for 12 years…”

00:08:42.868 --> 00:08:47.001
The strange activity would begin again after
the girls moved in in 1955. 

00:08:47.001 --> 00:08:52.700
The new target  is Janice, a young girl who is partially immobilized
by polio. After discovering her, Malthus uses

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:56.690
the form of Bee to sneak up on her and give
her a fright. At dinner the first night, the

00:08:56.690 --> 00:09:00.600
lights flicker, a sign that the evil is no
longer contained to that single closet.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.010
That night, it leaves Janice a note reading
“Find Me” -- referencing a game that Bee

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:07.660
used to play with her father. Janice is led
into Bee’s room, which is supposed to be

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:11.420
locked. Malthus has left the key to the closet
for her to find and discover the hiding place

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:15.720
of the doll. It makes her uncomfortable, so
she covers it up and attempts to lock it away,

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:19.500
but when her back is turned, the inhuman spirit
appears behind her, but when the sheet is

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.900
removed, Malthus is in a form not visible
to the human eye.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:26.390
More scary stuff begins to happen around the
house. Linda sees the doll move on it’s

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.120
own while playing hide and seek, and a mask
wearing form resembling Mrs. Mullins scares

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.520
the girls, disappearing as the light is turned
on.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:36.180
“That wasn’t a ghost. Ghosts can only
be of dead people.”

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.620
One night Janice is lured back into Bee’s
room, where she catches an apparition, asking

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.940
for her help.

00:09:42.698 --> 00:09:46.720
“Can you help me?”
“What do you need?”

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.160
“YOUR SOUL!”

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:52.450
Malthus proceeds to drag her around, leaving
a laceration on her leg. She manages to escape

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:56.430
the room, but Malthus slams all of the bedroom
doors so that she can’t get help, leaving her

00:09:56.430 --> 00:10:00.640
no option but to go for the stairlift. Isolating
the target to make her feel alone seems to

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.470
be a common tactic for Malthus.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:06.711
She looks up and sees the evil exiting room
in what appears to be a gaseous form. This

00:10:06.711 --> 00:10:10.370
is the only time we see the demon travel like
this, but I can only assume that this is how

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:14.190
it usually gets around, to be able to travel
through walls and perhaps to change itself

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.500
into multiple forms.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:19.380
Janet’s chair stalls ¾ of the way down,
so she tries to get up and crawl to safety

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:23.780
on her own. The last thing she sees is the
form of Bee, standing at the top of the stairs,

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:28.954
before she is AIR YEETED high into the foyer
air then dropped onto the cold hard floor.

00:10:28.954 --> 00:10:32.270
She later admits to Sister Charlotte, who
is in charge of all of the orphans, that she

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:36.410
believes the presence is preying on her because
she is the weakest, but Charlotte disagrees,

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:40.430
telling her that the devil preys on those
weak of faith, not weak of flesh or bone.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:44.280
The night she returns from the hospital, her
friend Linda has a few scary experiences with

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.840
Malthus. She looks through the keyhole to
Bee’s room and sees the Annabelle doll using

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:51.220
the rocking chair, but when she opens the
door, it’s nowhere to be seen.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:55.000
Then, as she’s playing with a ball shooter
in her room, the invisible entity grabs it

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.670
and raises it to the top of the doorframe
before yanking it from her hands. She hears

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:03.300
loud footsteps… or perhaps hoofsteps, running
towards her, so she hides in her top bunk

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:07.290
and listens, as the lights are turned off
and Malthus inhabits the lower bunk, leaving

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:11.610
behind charred black footsteps, another sign
of the burning the creature would have endured

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.440
in the deepest layers of hell.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.660
Linda looks down and sees Annabelle staring
back up at her, and she hides under the covers

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.630
after seeing Malthus, in it’s true demonic
form.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:24.510
At this point, Janice, Linda, and the two
older girls, Carol and Nancy have all had

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:28.650
scary experiences with Malthus, but it has
not yet attempted to possess any of them.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.500
I think the demon is testing each of the girls
to see whose faith is the weakest.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:36.880
Janice is the weakest of body, but it’s
possible that this also led to her faith being

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:41.290
weakened. As she becomes older and more crippled,
she realizes no family will want to take in

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.380
a broken child and that idea is demoralizing
for her.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:47.590
She’s also dealing with the fact that she’s
treated differently than the other girls due

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:51.250
to her condition, and this makes her an easy
target, because the demonic attacks can be

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:55.450
explained away as Janice lashing out as a
response to what she’s going through emotionally.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:59.070
She is at that age where her hormones can
take over her emotions, an age that is commonly

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.670
associated with attracting a poltergeist,
because the spirits are said to be attracted

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.690
to the negative feelings that come with nearing
those teenage years.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:09.230
The next day, Sister Charlotte takes her out
into the sunlight, and Malthus makes up its

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:13.030
mind about who to try to possess first. It
takes the form of a Nun, something we’ve

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:17.170
seen many times from its European counterpart,
Valak. The creepy nun is a popular form for

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.860
these demons to take, because it represents
an attack on the victim’s religious belief,

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:24.620
much like how the ominous knocking in The
Conjuring always comes in threes as an insult

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:25.640
to the holy trinity.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.780
This creepy nun shoves Janice out of her wheelchair
and into the barn, where it reverts to the

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:34.450
form of Bee, to crawl out of the shadows and
begin stage 3: possession. In The Conjurverse,

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:38.570
you basically just have to puke in someone’s
mouth to possess them… I guess. I think

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.910
Malthus essentially just made Janice give
up at this point. She had just gotten back

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:46.100
from the hospital and already, she was going
to have another demonic encounter and probably

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.100
another injury.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:51.370
With one victim possessed, Malthus had achieved
its goal, but remember the text in The Devil’s

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.010
Welcome: to “establish covenant” onto
the people and “for every living creature,

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:59.470
of all flesh that shall be upon the Earth.”
In other words, Malthus will now use Janice

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:03.300
to try to possess the bodies of the others,
then keep expanding out until the whole world

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.300
is taken over.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.950
For it’s next target, Malthus wants to take
advantage of the element of surprise, so when

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:11.850
Sister Charlotte comes in to check on her,
Janice pretends to be fine. But with the added

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.650
power of Janice, the ram demon decides to
try again with a target it was unable to possess

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.000
13 years ago.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:30.960
Mr. Mullins is alerted to the return of the
Annabelle doll from Linda, and goes inside

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:34.930
to find it ready to face him in his kitchen.
But the doll is not actually possessed by

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:39.260
Malthus, the demon only moves it around to
give the appearance of possession. As explained

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:41.160
later on by Lorraine Warren…

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.900
“Demonic spirits don't possess things, they
possess people.”

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:49.360
Janice does her best Lights Out Diana impersonation,
and transforms into its traditional gargoyle

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:53.610
or ram demon form, which I’ll be referring
to as it’s “true” form because that’s

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.960
what I picture in my head when I think about
a demon.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:14:00.150
This time, even holding up a cross is not
enough to protect him from the evil. I think

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:04.160
it’s a combination of Malthus gaining power
by possessing Janice and the fact that his

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.480
cross is home-made and he admits that it isn’t
his best work.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:11.840
Malthus brutally breaks off each of his fingers
one by one, forcing him to drop the cross

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:16.210
before moving in on him. Even if Mr. Mullins
supposedly wasn’t using his best cross,

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:20.820
it still speaks volumes to the power of Malthus.
We never see any of the other Conjuring villains

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:24.230
do anything like this. The scene represents
the power of belief.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:27.860
It’s a common trope for religious people
to claim that they found religion after a

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.940
personal tragedy. For Mr. Mullins, losing
his daughter created the negative energy that

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:36.830
initially attracted Malthus. So the idea of
turning to religion is used in a literal sense,

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.740
where bible pages and holy water are used
to seal the demon away. So now the movie is

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:45.400
showing us that letting go of religion, literally
dropping the cross, has opened him back up

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.180
to being vulnerable to Malthus.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:50.980
Linda realizes that the evil presence seems
to be connected to the creepy doll, and tries

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:54.430
to discard it in the well. Look Linda, just
because it worked for Coraline doesn’t mean

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:55.490
it’s gonna work for you.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:59.660
She once again hears heads hooves march up
behind her the closer she gets to the well.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:03.570
After dropping it in, she hears a small voice
call out, “help me”. It’s hard to tell

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:08.190
for sure, but it seems to be Bee’s voice,
so this is probably Malthus, once again trying

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:12.110
to mislead her by making her think that Bee’s
soul is trapped in the doll or something.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:16.480
It nearly works, because Linda is practically
dragged into the well by a pale pair of hands

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:20.860
with long fingers. This doesn’t appear to
be Bee or Janice. It could be the hands of

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:25.150
the Nun form I mentioned earlier, or it’s
possible there were other forms acquired before

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.150
Bee.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.960
With the help of Sister Charlotte, Linda is
saved, and the well is covered, but when they

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.530
return to the house, the Annabelle doll is
back on the couch where Janice had just been

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.670
sleeping. Charlotte takes the doll into Mrs.
Mullins’s room, looking for answers, and

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:38.690
her reaction speaks to the terror that it
brought her 12 years ago.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.370
“No! NO! Get that thing away from me!”

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.050
She claims that the evil has returned, calling
it “the devil itself,” which is probably

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:48.680
not accurate based on what we know from The
Devil’s Welcome. Malthus is just one of

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:52.750
many demons working under the devil, Belial.
With the demonic nature of the haunting now

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:57.150
revealed, Malthus can no longer rely on deception
to possess it’s victims, so with the game-plan

00:15:57.150 --> 00:16:00.080
out the window, it just launches a full on
offensive attack.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.880
At this point, we have multiple things going
on in multiple locations. I would still attribute

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:08.279
all of this activity to Malthus, but because
Janice is still alive and possessed by Malthus,

00:16:08.279 --> 00:16:12.350
she’s essentially programmed to act on its
behalf. So Janice can be upstairs terrorizing

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:16.420
the other orphans, while, Malthus is downstairs,
using whatever form it wants to torment Mrs.

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.420
Mullins.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:21.930
So Nancy, Carol and Tierney find Janice having
tea with the Annabelle doll and Janice attacks

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:26.230
Nancy. Sister Charlotte attempts to dispel
the demon using prayer, so Janice air yeets

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:29.960
her into a mirror. The girls try to scream
for help, but Janice has another idea.

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.320
“Or, you could help me?”

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:36.350
Meanwhile, Malthus cuts Mrs. Mullins in half,
crucifies her to the wall and rings her bell

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:40.380
to try to lure the girls into the room. They
are horrified by what they find, and try to

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:43.960
flee the property using Mr. Mullins’s truck,
where they encounter a scarecrow with the

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.680
ability to move on it’s own.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:48.880
Using the rules about these demons that have
been established, we can guess that this is

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.160
another one of Malthus’s tricks. Just like
with the Annabelle doll, the scarecrow is

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:55.710
not possessed, but simply moved around to
give the impression of possession.

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:59.240
The girls try to hide in the barn, but Carol
gets locked in alone, where she encounters

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.480
the scarecrow. Again, it’s in a position
reminiscent of a crucifix, and again, it ties

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:08.079
back into Malthus making a mockery of religious
symbols. She discovers the demonic true form

00:17:08.079 --> 00:17:12.240
hiding inside the scarecrow, and it busts
out, climbs to the ceiling, and descends upon

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:15.369
her, but she’s able to get away to the toy
shop, where Nancy finds her.

00:17:15.369 --> 00:17:18.929
In the house, Linda discovers the remains
of Mrs. Mullins, which jolt to life and come

00:17:18.929 --> 00:17:22.439
after her, so she hides in the dumbwaiter,
which Janice is able to crawl through to come

00:17:22.439 --> 00:17:26.600
after her. She sees the claw of Malthus’s
true form grasp onto the platform, meaning

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.980
that both the possessed Janice and the demon
itself are coming after her.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:33.669
She hides in the “blessed” closet where
Annabelle had once been sealed by the priest,

00:17:33.669 --> 00:17:37.020
but Janice finds her. Sister Charlotte is
able to rescue her once again by throwing

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:40.659
her cross necklace around Janice and locking
her into the closet. I think it’s quite

00:17:40.659 --> 00:17:44.159
fitting that Malthus is continually foiled
by an actual Nun.

00:17:44.159 --> 00:17:48.380
The pain caused by these religious items causes
Malthus to go crazy, causing the house to

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:53.340
shake, lights to flicker, electronics to glitch,
furniture to fly all around and glass to shatter.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.240
The demonic growl can even be heard from outside
the house as Malthus, despite the pain this

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:01.320
might have caused, penetrates the bible page
plastered wall allowing Janice to disappear

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:05.850
into the night. Only the Annabelle doll and
Sister Charlotte’s necklace are left behind.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.720
It appears that Malthus maybe stays with the
doll though, because after Father Massey blesses

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:13.549
the house, the doll is sent away with the
police. The Father claims that the evil is

00:18:13.549 --> 00:18:18.059
gone, and the doll is now just a doll, but
after being moved to a new bible-page-lined

00:18:18.059 --> 00:18:21.564
room, Annabelle is still under the control
of an external force.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:28.549
It seems that Malthus stayed with the doll
by choice. It’s later described by paranormal

00:18:28.549 --> 00:18:32.700
expert Ed Warren, who explains that the demonic
force is “latched onto” the doll.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:36.950
Of course, it’s never explicitly explained
why, but I would guess it’s for one of two

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:40.639
reasons. Perhaps Malthus saw value in remaining
with the Annabelle doll because it had proven

00:18:40.639 --> 00:18:44.600
itself successful as a way to trick people.
Or maybe there’s actually some kind of bond

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:49.230
being formed between the evil deity and this
handmade toy, in the same way that Ed Warren

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.240
describes the items in his cursed artifact
room.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.820
REPORTER: “Why not just throw them in an incinerator?
Destroy them."

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:01.169
ED: “Well, that would only destroy the vessel.
Sometimes it's better to keep the genie in

00:19:01.169 --> 00:19:02.169
the bottle.”

00:19:02.169 --> 00:19:06.140
Janice somehow ends up at St. Joachim Orphanage,
where she’s adopted by a couple named Mr.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:10.399
and Mrs. Higgins. She takes on the name Annabelle,
the actual first name of Bee. Although she

00:19:10.399 --> 00:19:14.309
is still possessed, she doesn’t immediately
take on an evil persona, instead, becoming

00:19:14.309 --> 00:19:17.869
more and more horrible over the next couple
years before eventually running away from

00:19:17.869 --> 00:19:19.240
home to join a cult.

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:23.799
Of course, the cult she joins is The Disciples
of Ram, the Charles Manson led group dedicated

00:19:23.799 --> 00:19:27.580
to summoning Malthus. She gets a crazy looking
cultist boyfriend, and although this part

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:31.049
of the story isn’t shown on screen, I’m
guessing it’s no coincidence that the Annabelle

00:19:31.049 --> 00:19:35.399
doll ends up in the hands of Mr. and Mrs.
Higgins’s next door neighbor, Mia Forme.

00:19:35.399 --> 00:19:38.850
Perhaps it was one of the cult’s evocation
spells that caused the doll to be moved so

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:39.950
close to home.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:44.649
On October 2nd 1967, twelve years after her
adoption into the Higgins family and roughly

00:19:44.649 --> 00:19:48.899
a decade after she ran away, Janice, now known
as Annabelle, would come home.

00:19:48.899 --> 00:19:51.304
"Annabelle Comes Home. Rated R."

00:19:51.304 --> 00:19:55.320
Nope. It’s still not you.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:05.640
As part of a ritual to call upon Malthus,
Janice and her boyfriend invade her adoptive

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:09.710
parents home one evening and slit their throats
before heading next door to steal back the

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:13.549
doll. This fulfills the blood sacrifice requirement
of the evocation spell.

00:20:13.549 --> 00:20:17.740
Part of the ritual to reawaken the demon also
seems to involve Janice offering herself while

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:22.149
holding the doll in her arms and possibly
leaving this A symbol on the wall in red paint.

00:20:22.149 --> 00:20:26.409
Or maybe she just felt that was an improvement
to the wallpaper of the nursery. I kind of

00:20:26.409 --> 00:20:27.409
like it.

00:20:27.409 --> 00:20:30.679
The summoning ritual seems to do the trick,
because the next day, unexplainable occurrences

00:20:30.679 --> 00:20:34.489
start happening in John and Mia's house, including
a sewing machine turning on in the middle

00:20:34.489 --> 00:20:38.289
of the night, the doll moving on its own,
and the day after that, unprovoked movement

00:20:38.289 --> 00:20:39.539
of a rocking chair.

00:20:39.539 --> 00:20:41.740
Mia tells her husband she can’t bear to
have the doll anymore.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:46.350
“That doll. You have to get rid of it. I
mean, she had it in her hands.”

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:50.730
But like the time Linda tried to dump the
doll down the well it somehow appears again.

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:54.340
It seems that if Malthus has its target set
on you, there’s nothing you can do to actually

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:57.694
get rid of the Annabelle doll. Unlike the
penguin from Mario 64.

00:20:57.694 --> 00:21:00.000
*sad penguin noises*

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:03.889
On October 5th, Malthus starts a fire in the
Form’s kitchen, and when a pregnant Mia

00:21:03.889 --> 00:21:07.619
tries to get away, she is AIR YEETED back
towards the flames.

00:21:07.619 --> 00:21:11.320
Thinking the house is haunted or something,
John and Mia move to Pasadena after Mia delivers

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:15.919
the baby. This is one of the classic horror
movie blunders. Malthus simply follows them

00:21:15.919 --> 00:21:19.741
there and continues to mess with them by screwing
with the TV and using the appearance of the

00:21:19.741 --> 00:21:23.860
child and teenage Janice to scare Mia and
get inside her head. Or at least something

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:28.460
that looks like Janice. I mean Malthus is a pretty
important demon, who I’m sure can’t be

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:32.270
bothered by little trivial details like what
Janice actually looks like.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:36.049
I also talked earlier about how Malthus was
able to exploit the negative emotions of the

00:21:36.049 --> 00:21:40.090
Mullins when they were in mourning. It uses
similar tactics here by listening in on John

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:43.830
and Mia’s conversations about the stress
caused by their new parenthood and John’s

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:45.640
job to divide them even further.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:49.220
Malthus seems to focus it’s attacks on when
Mia is home alone with the baby to make her

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:53.120
feel further isolated, like on October 7th
when it lures her into the living room while

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.710
hiding behind the curtain, a little trick
it picked up from Bee, then blasting her to

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:59.909
the ground and running away in the form of
Janice, or whatever.

00:21:59.909 --> 00:22:03.630
With Mia, Malthus is taking a somewhat similar
approach as it did with the Mullins. Instead

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:06.710
of tricking them into giving up their souls
with the false promise of speaking to their

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:10.190
daughter again, Malthus is pretending to go
after the soul of the baby, in hopes that

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:14.509
Mia will offer her soul in exchange for her
child’s safety.

00:22:14.509 --> 00:22:19.940
“Demon’s can’t just take souls Mia.
A soul needs to be offered before it can take

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:25.269
it.”
“And a baby cannot offer it’s soul.”

00:22:25.269 --> 00:22:29.019
So the next night, Malthus does everything
it can to make Mia feel that her baby is in

00:22:29.019 --> 00:22:32.820
danger. After putting Lia to bed, she goes
to the basement to put some stuff into storage

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:36.960
when she hears the sound of a baby fussing
and a carriage appears at the end of the room.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:40.999
She investigates to find that the stroller
is actually empty, and that this is a trap

00:22:40.999 --> 00:22:45.559
devised by Malthus in its true form. Malthus
grabs her forearm and scratches the “A”

00:22:45.559 --> 00:22:49.640
symbol onto it. The creature rises up to a
terrifying height as she runs away, and the

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:53.191
elevator won’t operate when she tries to
ride it to safety, forcing her to run back

00:22:53.191 --> 00:22:55.120
through the basement to get to the stairs.

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:59.559
She hears her baby crying as she runs out
a virtual suicide squeeze back to her apartment,

00:22:59.559 --> 00:23:04.059
but trips and drops her flashlight. When she
looks back over the edge she realizes Malthus

00:23:04.059 --> 00:23:08.539
is right below her, almost the same scenario
as when Linda saw Malthus in the bunk below

00:23:08.539 --> 00:23:10.309
her at the Mullins’ farmhouse.

00:23:10.309 --> 00:23:14.090
When she gets to her floor, she looks back
and sees Malthus, growling and staring at

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:18.379
her from less than one full light of stairs
below. Then, during one lightning strike,

00:23:18.379 --> 00:23:22.269
it has INSTANTLY advanced up to her level,
before she sprints the rest of the way into

00:23:22.269 --> 00:23:26.179
her apartment. This is one of the only times
we actually see Malthus use this method of

00:23:26.179 --> 00:23:31.320
extremely fast movement or possibly teleportation,
but it does help explain something about Annabelle

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:34.891
Creation. Specifically the part where it scares
the girls out of the downstairs bedroom, then

00:23:34.891 --> 00:23:37.340
is already waiting for them when they run
to the barn.

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:41.210
Some unspecified amount of time goes by. It’s
long enough that the scratch on Mia’s arm

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:45.269
has fully healed. On the way home from a book
store, she hears Janice / Annabelle whisper

00:23:45.269 --> 00:23:49.269
her name, and the baby stroller rolls into
the street and gets the old Gage Creed treatment

00:23:49.269 --> 00:23:53.020
from a garbage truck. Luckily for her, Lia
wasn’t in the stroller, but this is all

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:56.990
part of Malthus’s plan to make her feel
like giving up her soul is the only way to

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.059
save the baby.

00:23:58.059 --> 00:24:01.619
It continues this narrative later, when it
traps Mia in the nursery and bombards the

00:24:01.619 --> 00:24:05.380
baby with a barrage of heavy books off the
bookshelf. Mia is able to break out of the

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:09.090
room to get to her daughter, so Malthus terrifies
her by lifting up the Annabelle doll while

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:11.840
staring at her from the shadows with bloodshot
eyes.

00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:16.159
A terrified John and Mia send the doll away
with their priest, Father Perez, so Malthus

00:24:16.159 --> 00:24:19.909
goes along for the ride, lending more credence
to my theory that there is some kind of binding

00:24:19.909 --> 00:24:21.779
force between the demon and the doll.

00:24:21.779 --> 00:24:26.610
On the drive, Malthus interrupts the Father’s
baseball game by messing with the radio. Rude.

00:24:26.610 --> 00:24:27.610
Just rude.

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:31.129
The Father tries to bring the doll into the
church, and Malthus, perhaps remembering the

00:24:31.129 --> 00:24:35.619
pain inflicted by being locked away and surrounded
by holy items, channels a ton of its power

00:24:35.619 --> 00:24:41.009
and AIR YEETS Father Perez into the street.
Janice, or at least Malthus in its Janice

00:24:41.009 --> 00:24:43.169
form, takes the doll back to return it to
Mia.

00:24:43.169 --> 00:24:46.440
When John discovers what happened to Father
Perez, he tries to call and warn his wife,

00:24:46.440 --> 00:24:50.359
but Malthus messes with the phone lines. It’s
interesting to me that a demon that existed

00:24:50.359 --> 00:24:55.399
long before electronic technology does so
much tampering with phones, TVs and radios,

00:24:55.399 --> 00:25:00.169
but it makes sense that it would try to deceive
humans using their primary methods of communication.

00:25:00.169 --> 00:25:04.200
Just as it used a nun form before taking the
soul of Janice, it now uses the form of Father

00:25:04.200 --> 00:25:06.620
Perez to stage it’s final attack on her.

00:25:06.620 --> 00:25:10.520
“May God have mercy on your soul!”

00:25:10.520 --> 00:25:14.870
It pulls out all of the stops to try to convince
Mia to offer her soul, like playing demonic

00:25:14.870 --> 00:25:18.509
chanting over the record player, disfiguring
the dolls in the nursery, crawling on the

00:25:18.509 --> 00:25:22.450
ceiling and even kidnapping Lia, which sends
Mia into a desperate search for her daughter

00:25:22.450 --> 00:25:24.090
that culminates in her asking.

00:25:24.090 --> 00:25:26.119
“What do you want from me?”

00:25:26.119 --> 00:25:29.970
…And getting her answer written on the ceiling,
before getting the revised answer written

00:25:29.970 --> 00:25:32.397
on the opening window. This is a parallel
to Janice offering the knife to Linda in 1955.

00:25:32.397 --> 00:25:35.170
It’s a suggestion for Mia to give her life
so that Malthus can harvest her soul, but

00:25:35.170 --> 00:25:38.059
at the end of the day, she must be the one
to give herself up.

00:25:38.059 --> 00:25:42.010
John arrives just in time to save Mia from
throwing her life away, however, Malthus still

00:25:42.010 --> 00:25:45.299
ending up getting what it wanted in the end
when their friend Evelyn gives her own soul

00:25:45.299 --> 00:25:49.539
in Mia’s stead. So Malthus does win this
round, but the Form family gets their baby

00:25:49.539 --> 00:25:51.929
back, and the Annabelle doll disappears from
their lives.

00:25:51.929 --> 00:25:56.269
In April of 1968, the doll somehow ended up
in a gift shop, and where a woman who claimed

00:25:56.269 --> 00:25:59.690
to have been looking everywhere for one of
Mr Mullins's limited edition dolls picked

00:25:59.690 --> 00:26:02.850
it up and gave it to her daughter, Camilla,
as a birthday present.

00:26:02.850 --> 00:26:06.639
Like with each of the previous victims, Camilla
and her roommate Debbie start to notice small

00:26:06.639 --> 00:26:09.929
paranormal occurrences that ramp up over the
months that would follow.

00:26:09.929 --> 00:26:13.039
At first they would just notice the doll’s
hand or leg move. Then it would move from

00:26:13.039 --> 00:26:16.619
room to room when they were gone. They hired
a medium, who seemed to successfully make

00:26:16.619 --> 00:26:20.409
contact with the spirit of Annabelle Higgins
-- not realizing that she was actually talking

00:26:20.409 --> 00:26:24.879
to Malthus. Malthus told the medium that Annabelle
passed away in their apartment long ago and

00:26:24.879 --> 00:26:28.470
wanted permission to move into the doll and
be friends with the nurses that lived there.

00:26:28.470 --> 00:26:32.639
As we know by now, this was all a trick. They
began to find unsettling notes, which lead

00:26:32.639 --> 00:26:36.609
up to Malthus vandalizing their spare room.
They try throwing the doll into the dumpster…

00:26:36.609 --> 00:26:40.080
but as we know by now that doesn’t work
either. Debbie finds another ominous note

00:26:40.080 --> 00:26:43.860
and they discover the Annabelle doll sitting
back in the apartment once more.

00:26:43.860 --> 00:26:47.360
Something also happens between the doll and
one of their boyfriends, though it's not clear

00:26:47.360 --> 00:26:50.999
exactly what. Realising they’re in more
trouble than the medium led them to believe,

00:26:50.999 --> 00:26:55.370
they decide to call in the big help, and contact
renowned demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren.

00:26:55.370 --> 00:26:58.080
The Warrens explain how the inhuman spirit
tricked them.

00:26:58.080 --> 00:27:00.529
“You gave it permission to infest your lives.”

00:27:00.529 --> 00:27:04.350
Before things get any worse, Ed and Lorraine
call the church to have a priest sent in and

00:27:04.350 --> 00:27:07.970
bless the apartment and its inhabitants, which
seemed to do the trick. I think Malthus knew

00:27:07.970 --> 00:27:11.149
what it was up against here and decided to
calm down for the time being.

00:27:11.149 --> 00:27:14.789
The Warrens would take the doll with them
for safe keeping. Annabelle -- was finally

00:27:14.789 --> 00:27:15.937
-- coming home.

00:27:15.937 --> 00:27:17.441
“Annabelle Comes Home.

00:27:17.441 --> 00:27:18.169
Annabelle Comes Home.
Rated R.
Annabelle Comes Home.

00:27:18.169 --> 00:27:18.669
Comes. Comes. Comes.
Annabelle Comes Home.
Rated R.
Annabelle Comes.

00:27:18.669 --> 00:27:19.374
Comes. Annabelle.
Annabelle Comes Home.

00:27:20.251 --> 00:27:22.251
Experience it in IMAX.

00:27:27.830 --> 00:27:31.659
As Ed and Lorraine head back home after finally
securing the Annabelle doll, their car breaks

00:27:31.659 --> 00:27:36.039
down next to a cemetery in Maryville. Given
Malthus’s tendency to mess with lights,

00:27:36.039 --> 00:27:40.580
TVs, radios, telephones, record players, elevators
and chair lifts, I’m sure this breakdown

00:27:40.580 --> 00:27:44.190
was probably a result of the evil entity associated
with the doll.

00:27:44.190 --> 00:27:48.240
Malthus decided to do this next to a cemetery
because of another powerful attribute this

00:27:48.240 --> 00:27:49.350
demon possesses.

00:27:49.350 --> 00:27:53.309
“It’s the doll Ed. It’s a beacon for
other spirits.”

00:27:53.309 --> 00:27:57.190
So all of the lingering spirits from the graveyard
are drawn to Malthus, who is latched onto

00:27:57.190 --> 00:28:00.951
the doll, and Malthus is able to manipulate
these spirits into doing its bidding. One

00:28:00.951 --> 00:28:04.729
of them pushes Ed into the street in front
of a speeding truck. Jud Crandall would not

00:28:04.729 --> 00:28:05.729
have been pleased.

00:28:05.729 --> 00:28:07.590
“Don’t let him go in the road Lewis!”

00:28:07.590 --> 00:28:11.279
Malthus takes over the truck, so that the
driver has no control and tries to take out

00:28:11.279 --> 00:28:15.809
Ed, who is just barely able to dodge the oncoming
vehicle. The inhuman spirit was far more powerful

00:28:15.809 --> 00:28:17.090
than they anticipated.

00:28:17.090 --> 00:28:20.629
Their priest, Father Gordon, is waiting for
them when they arrive home. As they take Annabelle

00:28:20.629 --> 00:28:24.590
to the artifact room, the doll stares at their
young daughter Judy, perhaps perceiving her

00:28:24.590 --> 00:28:26.090
as a weaker target.

00:28:26.090 --> 00:28:29.899
At first, they leave the doll in a rocking
chair, but it causes complete chaos, making

00:28:29.899 --> 00:28:34.120
clocks run backwards and influencing the other
artifacts to come to life. A simple blessing

00:28:34.120 --> 00:28:37.990
and splash of holy water is not enough to
contain it, so they build a glass case using

00:28:37.990 --> 00:28:40.090
material from Trinity Church chapel.

00:28:40.090 --> 00:28:43.929
The doll gains a reputation as the Warrens’
most malevolent item -- at least at the time.

00:28:43.929 --> 00:28:47.690
It would continue to be housed at their home
in Monroe, Connecticut and be blessed twice a month

00:28:47.690 --> 00:28:48.690
by a priest.

00:28:48.690 --> 00:28:52.720
It would remain there for the next three years.
In 1971, while the Warrens are investigating

00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:56.610
a case in Rhode Island, they bring back the
spirit of a witch named Bathsheba. Because

00:28:56.610 --> 00:29:00.859
Bathsheba is particularly malicious, and because
Malthus is a beacon for other spirits, the

00:29:00.859 --> 00:29:04.509
witch becomes attracted to the doll and frees
it from the protective casing. In the middle

00:29:04.509 --> 00:29:07.679
of the night, Bathsheba takes the doll out
into one of the rooms.

00:29:07.679 --> 00:29:11.750
Judy is woken up by Bathsheba pulling at her
ankle and investigates the house. She finds

00:29:11.750 --> 00:29:16.429
Bathsheba rocking on a chair and combing Annabelle’s
hair in one of the rooms. Malthus turns Annabelle’s

00:29:16.429 --> 00:29:20.299
head to give the appearance that the doll
itself is turning to stare at Judy.

00:29:20.299 --> 00:29:23.320
She tries to exit the room, but finds that
she’s locked in, and the two malevolent

00:29:23.320 --> 00:29:27.859
spirits have disappeared from human sight.
This is a potentially disastrous situation,

00:29:27.859 --> 00:29:33.249
you have one inexperienced young medium trapped
inside with two powerful and malicious supernatural

00:29:33.249 --> 00:29:37.070
entities. One of them starts hurling furniture
at her, but luckily Ed and Lorranine get home

00:29:37.070 --> 00:29:40.059
in time to come to the rescue her before she
takes on any damage.

00:29:40.059 --> 00:29:43.669
Ed checks the cursed artifact room to see
if anything is out of order, but by that time

00:29:43.669 --> 00:29:48.109
Annabelle is back in the glass case, so this
potential catastrophe ends up being more of

00:29:48.109 --> 00:29:51.659
a minor incident, but perhaps this also reinvigorated
the demon’s spirit.

00:29:51.659 --> 00:29:56.239
The following year, in September 1972, shortly
before Judy Warren’s birthday party that

00:29:56.239 --> 00:29:59.870
year, a girl named Daniela Rios sneaks into
the Warrens’ artifact room and places a

00:29:59.870 --> 00:30:03.619
photo of her deceased father on the piano,
hoping to find a way to make contact with

00:30:03.619 --> 00:30:05.190
the other side to talk to him.

00:30:05.190 --> 00:30:08.870
Malthus senses that she’s a vulnerable target
because she’s in mourning, just like Mr.

00:30:08.870 --> 00:30:12.549
and Mrs. Mullins were. She asks for a sign
from any presence that might be in the room,

00:30:12.549 --> 00:30:16.320
so Malthus leans the Annabelle doll forward
against the glass. This causes Daniela to

00:30:16.320 --> 00:30:20.059
open the case and pick up the doll, but just
then a smoke alarm from the kitchen sends

00:30:20.059 --> 00:30:23.940
her quickly on her way. However, she forgets
to lock the case back up and Annabelle is

00:30:23.940 --> 00:30:25.799
finally able to escape again.

00:30:25.799 --> 00:30:29.759
As a beacon for other spirits, Malthus is
able to release many more horrifying entities

00:30:29.759 --> 00:30:33.429
from the objects that they are bound to. A
few of them include The Ferryman, The Black

00:30:33.429 --> 00:30:36.679
Shuck, The Haunted Wedding Dress of Anna Baker
and others.

00:30:36.679 --> 00:30:40.759
After escaping its prison, the Annabelle doll
sits at the kitchen table as Judy’s babysitter,

00:30:40.759 --> 00:30:45.210
Mary-Ellen, orders a pizza. The doorbell rings,
accompanied by the familiar set of three knocks.

00:30:45.210 --> 00:30:48.640
When Mary Ellen looks through the peephole,
no one is there, but when she opens the door,

00:30:48.640 --> 00:30:51.490
she sees Bee, who asks if Annabelle can come
play.

00:30:51.490 --> 00:30:55.169
When Mary-Ellen says she has the wrong house,
she tells her to look right behind her, but

00:30:55.169 --> 00:30:56.600
the doll is now gone.

00:30:56.600 --> 00:31:00.140
Malthus takes on different forms for different
people to try to deceive them. In Daniela’s

00:31:00.140 --> 00:31:03.859
case, it uses the form of her father, which
is part of Malthus’s plan to lul her into

00:31:03.859 --> 00:31:05.330
a sense of security.

00:31:05.330 --> 00:31:09.350
Later on, Judy senses something going on upstairs
and sees the bride associated with the haunted

00:31:09.350 --> 00:31:13.570
wedding dress go into one of the rooms. However,
this can’t just be the ghost on its own,

00:31:13.570 --> 00:31:17.369
because she finds a note that says “Miss
Me?” just like the nurses did when Malthus

00:31:17.369 --> 00:31:21.239
began terrorizing them. So when the bride
comes at her with a knife, it’s likely being

00:31:21.239 --> 00:31:22.760
driven by Malthus.

00:31:22.760 --> 00:31:25.879
Later that night, Malthus continues to haunt
Judy by hiding the remote under the couch

00:31:25.879 --> 00:31:28.610
and frightening her with the Annabelle doll
when she goes to look for it.

00:31:28.610 --> 00:31:32.379
The Black Shuck is a werewolf like creature
that guards the perimeter of the house, preventing

00:31:32.379 --> 00:31:36.249
Mary-Ellen’s love interest, Bob from offering
help to the three girls. Daniela, is lured

00:31:36.249 --> 00:31:40.220
into the cursed artifact room again when Malthus
leaves the door unlocked to tempt her.

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:43.740
She tries using the Mourning Bracelet, an
item said to let someone connect with a deceased

00:31:43.740 --> 00:31:47.909
loved one. While this bracelet does work for
Lorraine under the right circumstances, Malthus

00:31:47.909 --> 00:31:50.019
inferes with it by pretending to be her dad.

00:31:50.019 --> 00:31:53.470
She sees his face appear in the mirror, but
when she turns to look at him, one of his

00:31:53.470 --> 00:31:58.570
eyes is missing, much like Mrs. Mullins. Malthus
probably saw how much the one eyed Mrs. Mullins

00:31:58.570 --> 00:32:01.950
scared the girls back at the farmhouse and
decided to try to use it again on Daniela.

00:32:01.950 --> 00:32:05.940
That’s probably what makes Malthus one of
the cleverest and most dangerous inhuman spirits

00:32:05.940 --> 00:32:10.210
in the Conjuring franchise -- it never forgets
an old trick. So the longer it sticks around,

00:32:10.210 --> 00:32:13.840
the more tactics it learns, and the better
it gets at deceiving its prey and coercing

00:32:13.840 --> 00:32:18.279
them to give up their souls. That fact that
it still uses Bee Mullins as one of its forms

00:32:18.279 --> 00:32:22.929
29 years after her death, just proves that
Malthus always still has an old trick at its

00:32:22.929 --> 00:32:23.929
disposal.

00:32:23.929 --> 00:32:27.710
As with the Mullins and Form residence hauntings
before, Malthus ramps things up throughout

00:32:27.710 --> 00:32:30.269
the night to try to put its victims on edge.

00:32:30.269 --> 00:32:33.889
First it shatters Mary-Ellen’s milk glass,
then randomly turns on the radio. When she

00:32:33.889 --> 00:32:37.690
checks in on the sleeping Judy, Mary-Ellen
discovers the Annabelle doll under the covers.

00:32:37.690 --> 00:32:41.649
She finds it kind of disturbing, but doesn’t
know the doll is attached to an evil entity,

00:32:41.649 --> 00:32:45.350
so doesn’t think much of it. When she goes
back downstairs, the TV is on.

00:32:45.350 --> 00:32:49.800
Malthus also messes with a TV inside the artifact
the room where Daniela is. This time, instead

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:53.820
of pulling out another old trick, it puts
a new one on display by making the television

00:32:53.820 --> 00:32:57.860
show what happens a few seconds into the future.
Like many of the strange things that happen

00:32:57.860 --> 00:33:02.080
in The Conjurverse, this phenomenon isn’t
ever explained, but I personally think it’s

00:33:02.080 --> 00:33:03.179
actually very simple.

00:33:03.179 --> 00:33:06.999
If Lorraine has a clairvoyant ability, which
allows her to foresee future events, like

00:33:06.999 --> 00:33:10.860
her daughter being in danger in The Conjuring
1 and her husband being in danger in The Conjuring

00:33:10.860 --> 00:33:14.979
2, who’s to say that Malthus doesn’t also
have a touch of clairvoyance? And since we’ve

00:33:14.979 --> 00:33:18.549
already seen that Malthus has the ability
to make any electronics go haywire, it doesn’t

00:33:18.549 --> 00:33:21.529
seem like too much of a stretch for it to
be able to display these future events on

00:33:21.529 --> 00:33:22.799
a TV screen.

00:33:22.799 --> 00:33:26.470
Meanwhile, Mary-Ellen hears a tape player
playing audio of Ed and Lorraine’s case

00:33:26.470 --> 00:33:31.320
file on their investigation of The Ferryman,
evil spirit set loose by Malthus. She find

00:33:31.320 --> 00:33:34.919
the source of the audio and turns it off.
The Ferryman is known for putting coins over

00:33:34.919 --> 00:33:39.019
the eyes of its victims, and she follows a
trail of coins until she sees a pair of them

00:33:39.019 --> 00:33:42.419
seemingly floating on the ceiling. We saw
Malthus hide on the ceiling before attacking

00:33:42.419 --> 00:33:47.270
both Carol in 1955 and Evelyn in 1967. So
seeing the Ferryman use this approach 

00:33:47.270 --> 00:33:51.299
means that Malthus was probably involved.
It’s likely using the Ferryman as a conduit

00:33:51.299 --> 00:33:55.479
in the same way we saw Valak use the ghost
of Bill Wilkins in the Conjuring 2.

00:33:55.479 --> 00:33:59.889
Mary-Ellen runs for it, but she trips on something
and gets AIR YEETED back into the dark. Using

00:33:59.889 --> 00:34:03.409
her flashlight, she’s able to temporarily
free herself from the evil spirit’s grip.

00:34:03.409 --> 00:34:07.159
She immediately high-tails it to Judy’s
room, but Judy would have her own confrontation

00:34:07.159 --> 00:34:13.690
in which Malthus would bring out it’s full
arsenal of alternate forms.

00:34:20.450 --> 00:34:24.660
Judy sleeps next to a revolving color wheel
lamp, a novelty item that dates back to the

00:34:24.660 --> 00:34:29.330
1950s. This lamp would have an usual effect
on the demon, Malthus. It begins with Malthus

00:34:29.330 --> 00:34:33.120
dragging Judy by the ankle to wake her up.
This is exactly how Bathsheba woke up her

00:34:33.120 --> 00:34:36.810
victims in The Conjuring, though it’s not
clear if Bathsheba actually escaped the music

00:34:36.810 --> 00:34:40.390
box it was captured in, or if Malthus just
learned this from the witch’s ghost when

00:34:40.390 --> 00:34:41.620
they met the previous year.

00:34:41.620 --> 00:34:45.390
When she wakes up, Judy quickly realizes something
is wrong when she discovers the Annabelle

00:34:45.390 --> 00:34:49.231
doll underneath the covers with her. Bee appears
from under the covers at the foot of the bed

00:34:49.231 --> 00:34:52.870
and scares her, causing her to knock over
the color wheel. It continues to spin and

00:34:52.870 --> 00:34:56.710
project it’s colored light onto the wall.
As each color changes, a different form of

00:34:56.710 --> 00:35:01.310
Malthus is displayed. It starts with the doll,
then Bee, then the adult version of Janice,

00:35:01.310 --> 00:35:04.380
and finally the rarely seen “true form”
of Malthus.

00:35:04.380 --> 00:35:07.580
It then appears behind her on the bed and
screeches at her. She bolts out of the room,

00:35:07.580 --> 00:35:11.170
where Mary-Ellen is waiting for her. With
the Black Shuck outside, they realize they’re

00:35:11.170 --> 00:35:14.460
trapped in. They place a call to Lorraine
for help, but Malthus has manipulated the

00:35:14.460 --> 00:35:16.140
phone lines as well.

00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:22.123
LORRAINE: “Can I speak to Annabelle?”
MARY-ELLEN: “I’m sorry?”

00:35:22.123 --> 00:35:24.287
LORRAINE: “You need to give her a soul,
dear.”

00:35:24.287 --> 00:35:28.759
MARY-ELLEN: “What?”
LORRAINE: “A soul? She wants her soul. Give

00:35:28.759 --> 00:35:30.845
me her soul.”

00:35:30.845 --> 00:35:35.390
That’s even more annoying than telemarketers.
Well… no maybe not that annoying.

00:35:35.390 --> 00:35:38.410
Before trying to make an attempt on one of
their souls, all of the bells in the house

00:35:38.410 --> 00:35:42.460
start ringing, which might be another callback
to Mrs. Mullins, who had a bedside handbell

00:35:42.460 --> 00:35:46.390
to request help. Then the typewriter goes
all Jack Torrance and writes the words “Miss

00:35:46.390 --> 00:35:50.170
Me” over and over. A phone starts ringing
in the artifact room, and Judy and Mary-Ellen

00:35:50.170 --> 00:35:53.790
get in there just in time to stop Daniela
from touching it. She admits to being the

00:35:53.790 --> 00:35:57.820
one who let Annabelle out of the case, and
has bad news regarding the other spirits in

00:35:57.820 --> 00:35:58.320
the room.

00:35:58.589 --> 00:36:02.785
JUDY: “What else did you touch?”
DANIELA: “Everything.”

00:36:06.890 --> 00:36:10.800
This sends Mary-Ellen into an asthma attack,
but as Judy goes to fetch her inhaler, the

00:36:10.800 --> 00:36:14.850
creepy bride sneaks up on Daniela, using the
same teleport forward mechanic that Malthus

00:36:14.850 --> 00:36:16.600
used on Mia Form in the stairwell.

00:36:16.600 --> 00:36:20.041
It appears that she’s stabbed Daniela in
the stomach, but it is only an illusion. She

00:36:20.041 --> 00:36:23.800
pins her to the ground and pukes inside of
her mouth, so for the first time since Janice

00:36:23.800 --> 00:36:26.610
in 1955, Malthus has a new vessel.

00:36:26.610 --> 00:36:30.140
After Judy safely returns with the inhaler,
Daniela tries to beckon the two of them to

00:36:30.140 --> 00:36:34.560
go upstairs, but Judy, taking after her mother’s
medium abilities, senses something is wrong

00:36:34.560 --> 00:36:38.010
and leads Mary-Ellen to try to find the Annabelle
doll so they can put an end to the horror

00:36:38.010 --> 00:36:39.410
they were living through that night.

00:36:39.410 --> 00:36:43.090
They find the cursed childrens toy in the
closet inside the Warrens’ office, but the

00:36:43.090 --> 00:36:46.980
door is locked, so they have to play this
board game, Feely Meely in order to win the

00:36:46.980 --> 00:36:50.610
key. I found it a bit strange that this evil
inhuman spirit would just stop in the middle

00:36:50.610 --> 00:36:54.130
of everything to strike up a board game with
these kids, but when I went back, I realized

00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:57.620
that the game is seen in the room of cursed
objects at the beginning, so this is probably

00:36:57.620 --> 00:37:01.810
another trial where Malthus is manipulating
whatever evil spirit was living in this board

00:37:01.810 --> 00:37:02.810
game.

00:37:02.810 --> 00:37:05.860
Judy is able to win the key, and Mary-Ellen
ventures into the closet, which now resembles

00:37:05.860 --> 00:37:09.560
the Ferryman’s tombs. She’s only able
to toss the doll back to Judy before being

00:37:09.560 --> 00:37:13.540
pulled back into the abyss, but Judy recovers
the fumble and makes a break for the end zone

00:37:13.540 --> 00:37:18.180
before being met with Daniela, who is infused
with both the evil of Malthus and the ire

00:37:18.180 --> 00:37:19.790
of the wedding dress spirit.

00:37:19.790 --> 00:37:23.390
Mary-Ellen comes in with a key block and Big
Brain Judy’s fast thinking probably saves

00:37:23.390 --> 00:37:28.200
a couple lives when she turns on a projector
with a recording of Ed performing an exorcism.

00:37:28.200 --> 00:37:32.000
This essentially seems to have the same effect
as him performing the actual exorcism and

00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:35.050
causes immense pain to the demonic presence
inside of her.

00:37:35.050 --> 00:37:39.040
This buys them just enough time to get Annabelle
back to its case, but when Judy opens it Malthus

00:37:39.040 --> 00:37:43.550
slams it shut, corners her, and attempts to
suck out Judy’s soul using a Dementor’s

00:37:43.550 --> 00:37:47.450
kiss. As you may know, the Dementor’s kiss
is an act performed by the wraithlike species

00:37:47.450 --> 00:37:51.710
of prison guards in The Wizarding World (aka
the Harry Potter franchise) to suck out the

00:37:51.710 --> 00:37:53.580
soul of anyone who gets in their way.

00:37:53.580 --> 00:37:57.230
The Conjurverse and the Wizarding World may
both be Warner Bros. properties, but they

00:37:57.230 --> 00:38:01.180
are not the same universe. However, Malthus
doesn’t seem to care, and nearly performs

00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:04.810
the Dementor’s kiss on Judy. Mary-Ellen
tries to come in and save her, so Malthus

00:38:04.810 --> 00:38:07.770
gets in one last AIR YEET and sends her flying
into the wall.

00:38:07.770 --> 00:38:11.810
But this gives Judy just enough time to grab
a nearby cross, something she probably should

00:38:11.810 --> 00:38:15.790
have gone for a while ago, and press it to
Malthus’s head. Mary-Ellen places the Annabelle

00:38:15.790 --> 00:38:19.260
doll back into the chapel glass case, but
Malthus’s power prevents her from being

00:38:19.260 --> 00:38:23.360
able to force it shut. Things look hopeless
as all of the escaped evil spirits from that

00:38:23.360 --> 00:38:27.830
night surround them, but luckily for them,
Daniela shows up, now free of the demonic

00:38:27.830 --> 00:38:31.370
possession. She is the only character that
we know of ever to be freed from Malthus’s

00:38:31.370 --> 00:38:35.151
grip, and with her strength, they’re able
to force Annabelle’s case closed. I can

00:38:35.151 --> 00:38:39.760
only imagine that Daniela never actually gave
in to the idea of Malthus taking her soul,

00:38:39.760 --> 00:38:43.890
and that's why she was able to be exorcised.
The doll and the demonic presence bound to

00:38:43.890 --> 00:38:48.240
it are once again sealed, and without the
spiritual beacon of the Annabelle doll, Malthus

00:38:48.240 --> 00:38:51.960
and the other spirits are no longer able to
materialize in our world.

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:55.430
“The evil has been contained.”
And as far as we know, Malthus would remain

00:38:55.430 --> 00:38:58.810
locked in Ed and Lorraine Warren’s cursed
artifact room from that point forward.

00:38:58.810 --> 00:38:59.810
That concludes Malthus’s history in the
canon of the The Conjuring Universe movies,

00:38:59.810 --> 00:39:03.500
but the real life story is perhaps open to
another chapter. Lorraine Warren passed away

00:39:03.500 --> 00:39:08.170
in April of 2019 and left the cursed artifact
room, which is known in real life as the Warrens’

00:39:08.170 --> 00:39:11.770
Occult Museum to her son in law, Tony Spera.
That’s Judy’s husband.

00:39:11.770 --> 00:39:15.510
In 2020, because of course this would happen
in 2020, it was reported that The Annabelle

00:39:15.510 --> 00:39:19.370
doll had somehow “escaped” and was now
missing from the room. Tony Spera took to

00:39:19.370 --> 00:39:21.160
YouTube to shoot down those rumors.

00:39:21.160 --> 00:39:28.100
“Annabelle’s here. She didn’t go anywhere.
She didn’t take a trip... So you know. Here

00:39:28.100 --> 00:39:30.580
she is. Let’s put the rumors to rest guys.”

00:39:30.580 --> 00:39:35.020
But during this fiasco, it also came out that
Tony and Judy were looking to relocate the

00:39:35.020 --> 00:39:38.720
museum, which has been closed for some time
due to zoning issues. So it’s not hard to

00:39:38.720 --> 00:39:43.130
imagine a future Conjurverse story where one
of the movers doesn’t take the proper precautions

00:39:43.130 --> 00:39:46.060
with The Annabelle doll and Malthus is set
loose once more.

00:39:46.060 --> 00:39:49.730
We’ve seen a lot of these “many years
later” horror sequels recently, so maybe

00:39:49.730 --> 00:39:52.600
a modern day Annabelle sequel could eventually
be in the cards.

00:39:52.600 --> 00:39:56.421
Let me know in the comments which other Conjurverse
characters or entities you’d like to see

00:39:56.421 --> 00:40:01.100
covered next here on Horror History and if
you love horror remember to subscribe to CZsWorld

00:40:01.100 --> 00:40:05.540
for new horrors every week, RING the deathbell,
not the spirit bell, for notifications and

00:40:05.540 --> 00:40:09.140
I will see you in the next one. Assuming we
both survive.

